{12}{Sorry!  Didn't mean to offend you, sir!  I'll just get our of your way!  But, please!  Reconsider and talk with me before the negotiations begin!  I'll be here!}{Sorry!  Didn't mean to offend you, madam!  I'll just get our of your way!  But, please!  Reconsider and talk with me before the negotiations begin!  I'll be here!}{}{}{}{}
{15}{You may be aware of the growing problems with labor unions in Tarant...they're bringing production efficiency down and driving manufacturing costs up!  We can't have that happen here in Caladon, sir!  We need the labor unions to be outlawed here!  I believe that we can convince you of the compelling nature of our argument...}{You may be aware of the growing problems with labor unions in Tarant...they're bringing production efficiency down and driving manufacturing costs up!  We can't have that happen here in Caladon, madam!  We need the labor unions to be outlawed here!  I believe that we can convince you of the compelling nature of our argument...}{}{}{}{gf2243 1}
{16}{How do you plan on convincing me?}{}{5}{}{18}{}
{18}{[The man lowers his voice, looking to and fro.]  If you should happen to include that labor unions are outlawed in the signed agreement, we would be most grateful.  The manifestation of that gratitude would be in the form of 1500 gold pieces...}{[The man lowers his voice, looking to and fro.]  If you should happen to include that labor unions are outlawed in the signed agreement, we would be most grateful.  The manifestation of that gratitude would be in the form of 1500 gold pieces...}{}{}{}{}
